Package: foxy-drivers
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash, python3
Recommends: build-essential, linux-libc-dev
Description: Low-level Foxy robot hardware drivers
 Installs the Foxy single-header C driver, the batteryd daemon/client header,
 and the systemd units used to enable the Foxy HAT GPIO mapping and publish
 battery status/control through /run/batteryd.
